{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-21","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Das Passiv","bn":"Passiv: কী করা হয়"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Auto ___ repariert.","options":["hat","wird","werden"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Passiv: werden + Partizip II; das Auto → wird।","id":"b1-practice-21-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die E-Mail wird ___. (schreiben)","options":["schreibt","schreiben","geschrieben"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-21-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Das Auto wurde repariert.“ মানে কী?","options":["গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হয়েছিল।","গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হচ্ছে।","গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হবে।"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-21-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Fenster ___ geputzt.","options":["werdet","werden","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"বহুবচন → werden।","id":"b1-practice-21-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"অতীতের Passiv-এ কোন রূপ লাগে?","options":["wird + infinitive","würde + infinitive","wurde + Partizip II"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-21-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Der Mechaniker repariert das Auto.“ এর Passiv কোনটি?","options":["Das Auto wird repariert.","Das Auto repariert.","Das Auto hat repariert."],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-21-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Gestern ___ die Wohnung geputzt.","options":["würde","wurde","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"gestern → অতীত: wurde।","id":"b1-practice-21-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Hier ___ Deutsch gelernt.","options":["werden","ist","wird"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-21-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Du ___ weniger Zucker essen. (পরামর্শ)","options":["solltest","sollst","sollte"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-21-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„An deiner Stelle würde ich zum Arzt gehen.“ মানে কী?","options":["তুমি ডাক্তারের কাছে গিয়েছিলে।","তোমার জায়গায় আমি হলে ডাক্তারের কাছে যেতাম।","আমি তোমার সাথে ডাক্তারের কাছে যাব।"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-21-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„satt“ মানে কী?","options":["ক্ষুধার্ত","ঝাল","তৃপ্ত, পেট ভরা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-21-q11"},{"